### Start a session
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/profile
Accept: application/json

{
  "startLat": 1.3483,
  "startLng": 103.6831,
  "destLat": 1.3521,
  "destLng": 103.8198,
  "destinationLabel": "Test Destination"
}

### Ping (replace sessionId with response from start)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/navigation/ping
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjowMmI4YTIzYi0zM2U3LTQ0M2ItODA3Ni03NDFkMGU4NGEzMGI=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "timestamp": "2026-03-05T00:00:00Z",
  "lat": 1.34835,
  "lng": 103.68315,
  "speedMps": 2.3,
  "headingDeg": 90.0,
  "accuracyM": 5.0
}

### Stop (replace sessionId)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/navigation/stop
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjowMmI4YTIzYi0zM2U3LTQ0M2ItODA3Ni03NDFkMGU4NGEzMGI=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1
}

### List sessions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/navigation/sessions
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjowMmI4YTIzYi0zM2U3LTQ0M2ItODA3Ni03NDFkMGU4NGEzMGI=
Accept: application/json

### Session detail (replace id)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/navigation/sessions/1
Accept: application/json